Hi, Dan.

You probably want to do the dist() on the transposed matrix.  

> a <- matrix(rnorm(20000),nc=10) # a 2000 x 10 matrix
> b <- dist(a)
> dim(as.matrix(b))
[1] 2000 2000
> d <- cor(a)
> dim(d)
[1] 10 10

Note the difference in sizes of the matrices.

Sean


